# Ixalli's Lorekeeper: "{T}: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast a Dinosaur spell or activate an ability
# of a Dinosaur source" (CR 106.6). Turn 1 Black Lotus makes {R}{R}{R} for Blazing Rootwalla and Mox Emerald's {G} casts the
# Lorekeeper, which is summoning sick, so its {T} ability is refused (CR 302.6). Turn 3 the Lorekeeper's {R} is the only red
